{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏のひとこま"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とある古着屋さんをぶらぶらしていたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんだか「他の星から」の衣装っぽいっ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "値札を見ると1200円!!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "買うしかないと、とある服を勢いで購入しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けれど、いつどんな時に来たらいいかな〜って"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "結構悩んだのですね…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そこで思い立ちました"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVに出てくる、歌詞に出てくるあの場所に行ってみようと！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あんみつ食べられればそれ以上の贅沢は望まない🎶"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob2DZw3Y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobweenHi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/moboAg123.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お母さんと久しぶりのまったりデーでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美味しい白玉3つ⚪️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どうかな、ちょっとぽい感じしませんか？"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobydpJHM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "思いつきの、楽しいひととき共有でした。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobfJbdcB.jpg", "alt": ""}], "source": "official"}